{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANIWARS is a strategic turn-based roguelike where you play as a faction Commander. Lead your squad, collect powerful items, conquer territory and face off against the other powerful rival Commanders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.poster.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.webm?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.mp4?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE STRATEGIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through difficult encounters where you must use everything at your disposal to prevail against the enemy, be it unique abilities, using the environment to your advantage, capturing objectives or finding the perfect use for the item you picked up earlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY &amp; FACTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For over half a century, the world has been engulfed in an unending conflict. It all started after Void Day, a cataclysmic event where all of Vertex\u2019s Dark Matter drives around the globe imploded creating Void Zones which swallowed cities and ripped apart continents. From the chaos three factions emerged: the Military, PUNKZ and Vertex. Each faction has its own style in both design and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/a16e4a6bca0b58799eff288749255372.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE COMMANDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commanders function both as playable characters and bosses! Every Commander has their own story, unique evolving dialogue and a key role in uncovering the secrets and conspiracies of ANIWARS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/40411d46340dc3749fe9a2261277445e.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture territory, gather resources and gain enough power to challenge the rival Commander at the end. In each run you will make your way through multiple maps, with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.poster.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.webm?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.mp4?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INFINITE REPLAYABILITY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 items &amp; consumables with wild combos, dozens of events &amp; encounters, the unit trait system and mercenaries make each run of ANIWARS a unique experience! And this is just for the Early Access release, there is more to come. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPCOMING CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Items &amp; Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faction-neutral Mercenary Unit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Items, Achievements &amp; Challenge Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Faction: 4 units &amp; 2 Commanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret unlockable Commander</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Completed ANIWARS story, including all Commanders\u2019 personal stories </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2269540?t=1757071334","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/d0b20613001759e053b383a132c97e5add7c85d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757071334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/4548bb1396d399f629bc0348816a07a2d7666a30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757071334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/4548bb1396d399f629bc0348816a07a2d7666a30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757071334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANIWARS is a strategic turn-based roguelike where you play as a faction Commander. Lead your squad, collect powerful items, conquer territory and face off against the other powerful rival Commanders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.poster.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.webm?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1de1ff9946136cbff6652b75b483101.mp4?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE STRATEGIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through difficult encounters where you must use everything at your disposal to prevail against the enemy, be it unique abilities, using the environment to your advantage, capturing objectives or finding the perfect use for the item you picked up earlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY &amp; FACTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For over half a century, the world has been engulfed in an unending conflict. It all started after Void Day, a cataclysmic event where all of Vertex\u2019s Dark Matter drives around the globe imploded creating Void Zones which swallowed cities and ripped apart continents. From the chaos three factions emerged: the Military, PUNKZ and Vertex. Each faction has its own style in both design and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/a16e4a6bca0b58799eff288749255372.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE COMMANDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commanders function both as playable characters and bosses! Every Commander has their own story, unique evolving dialogue and a key role in uncovering the secrets and conspiracies of ANIWARS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/40411d46340dc3749fe9a2261277445e.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture territory, gather resources and gain enough power to challenge the rival Commander at the end. In each run you will make your way through multiple maps, with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.poster.avif?t=1757071334\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.webm?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.mp4?t=1757071334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INFINITE REPLAYABILITY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 items &amp; consumables with wild combos, dozens of events &amp; encounters, the unit trait system and mercenaries make each run of ANIWARS a unique experience! And this is just for the Early Access release, there is more to come. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPCOMING CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Items &amp; Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faction-neutral Mercenary Unit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Items, Achievements &amp; Challenge Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Faction: 4 units &amp; 2 Commanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret unlockable Commander</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Completed ANIWARS story, including all Commanders\u2019 personal stories </p></li></ul>","developers":["Breaker Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/8397bc41f05e5f70827da0608c35420a8327c0ad/header.jpg?t=1757071334","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92022 BREAKER INTERACTIVE AB. Developed and published by BREAKER INTE